fix: Convert double quotes to single quotes (Q000) and fix C417

Fix ~300 flake8-quotes Q000 violations across 26 files in 11 packages.
The ament_flake8 CI uses flake8-quotes which enforces single-quote
preference. Also fix C417 (unnecessary map) in Config.py by converting
to a generator expression.

All 11 packages now pass flake8 locally with the full ament_flake8
plugin set (flake8-quotes, flake8-comprehensions, flake8-import-order,
flake8-commas, flake8-builtins, flake8-docstrings, pep8-naming).
